304_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0TWbEowPEOkQ7kNvwGE7wl_&_nc_oc=AdoKGq1Kb8wZX-gy7GIOuFxuSx6kvpfD5fQ9v73ehJvn26O_VLn_LlCE9MqhutTBSuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7UsZmr50bNY8qxePLtRhlAmcPrbi1KYAjFQeCNXuj3bw&oe=6A11A1F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Underwater", "keywords": ["sea", "fishes", "mondomarino", "sealife", "ocean"], "long_description": "Underwater is a virtual reality experience, designed for children, that transports you to discover a colorful marine world. Use the optical pointer to interact with the inhabitants of the sea: crabs, clown fish, dolphins, whales, submarines, jellyfishes and butterfly fish will appear one at a time and will come alive before your eyes.", "short_description": "An interactive virtual reality experience to discover a colorful underwater world, designed for children."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "575407160551276", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Underwater", "keywords": ["mare", "pesci", "mondomarino", "sea", "ocean"], "long_description": "Underwater \u00e8 un\u2019esperienza di realt\u00e0 virtuale che ti trasporta alla scoperta di un coloratissimo mondo marino. Usa il puntatore ottico per interagire con gli abitanti del mare: granchietti, pesci pagliaccio, orche, delfini, balene, sottomarini, meduse e pesci farfalla appariranno uno alla volta e si animeranno davanti ai tuoi occhi.", "short_description": "Un'esperienza di realt\u00e0 virtuale interattiva per trasportare i pi\u00f9 piccoli alla scoperta di un coloratissimo mondo marino."}]}, "developer_name": "Digital Mosaik", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lab.digitalmosaik.com/en/underwater-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Mosaik", "support_website_url": "https://www.digitalmosaik.com/", "website_url": "https://www.digitalmosaik.co